# Cursor already skips everything in .gitignore (node_modules, dist, *.zip,
# coverage) and its default list (lockfiles, images, archives). This file only
# adds tracked files that are noise for the agent. It is a hard block: ignored
# files can't be read or @-mentioned, so keep it short.

